# M9 key rebinding (ui.md 6): bopl-port --headless --drive scripts/dev/m9-remap.drive
#   --screenshot scratch/m9/remap.png
# Keyboard + mouse joins, rebinds jump/abilities/directions (one clash), a
# controller joins and rebinds its four buttons, a second controller joins
# and keeps the defaults (bindings are per player box), the keyboard player
# readies with the new jump key... then a match where the new keys play.
60 press km accept
0 wait charsel
30 key Return                 # keyboard + mouse joins box 0
20 press km up                # team row -> rebind row
15 shot 01-rebind-row
5 key Return                  # start rebinding
20 shot 02-rebind-start
10 key K                      # jump
10 key Mouse1                 # ability left (slot 0)
10 shot 03-two-bound
5 key K                       # clash: wiggle + smallError
6 shot 04-clash
20 key Mouse3                 # ability top (slot 2)
10 key Mouse2                 # ability right (slot 1)
10 key I                      # up
15 shot 05-directions
5 key J                       # left
10 key Down                   # down
10 key L                      # right: done (accept2)
20 shot 06-done
# a controller joins and rebinds jump/abilities
10 button pad0 a
20 press pad0 up
10 button pad0 a
20 button pad0 dpup           # refused (reserved)
10 button pad0 rightshoulder  # jump
10 button pad0 x              # left
10 shot 07-pad-rebinding
10 button pad0 leftshoulder   # top
10 button pad0 b              # right: done
20 shot 08-pad-done
10 button pad1 a              # a second controller joins box 2 (defaults)
20 shot 08b-pad1-joined
# keyboard player: down to the ready button (Down is still the down key)
10 key Down 4
10 key Down 4
10 key Down 4
10 key Down 4
10 key Down 4
10 key Down 4
10 key Return                 # ready
10 button pad0 start          # pad ready
10 button pad1 start          # second pad ready
20 shot 09-ready
10 key Return                 # start
0 wait round
100 shot 09b-round
120 key K 10                  # the new jump key
14 shot 10-jump-k
40 button pad0 rightshoulder 10
14 shot 11-pad-jump
40 button pad1 a 10           # pad1 still jumps with A
14 shot 12-pad1-a-jump
40 button pad0 a 10           # pad0's A is unbound now: nothing
14 shot 13-pad0-a-nothing
60 quit
